@startuml 顺序图-UC03-提交预约申请
title 顺序图 · UC-03 提交预约申请（含 UC-04 / UC-05）
skinparam defaultFontName "Noto Sans CJK SC"
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam maxMessageSize 170
autonumber
hide footbox

actor "预约用户" as User
participant "预约申请界面" as UI
participant "预约控制器\n(应用服务)" as Controller
participant "预约规则校验器\nReservationPolicy" as Policy
participant "课表适配器" as Schedule
participant "预约仓储" as Repo
database "数据库\n区间互斥约束" as DB
participant "通知服务\n(Outbox)" as Notify

User -> UI: 填写用途、教室、时段、人数与材料
UI -> Controller: POST /reservations\nIdempotency-Key + CreateReservation
Controller -> Repo: findByRequestId(userId, requestId)
Repo -> DB: 查询请求幂等记录
DB --> Repo: 无记录
Repo --> Controller: 无记录

Controller -> Policy: validate(candidate, operator)
Policy -> Policy: 校验时间窗、提前量、时长、\n容量、信用、在途数与材料
Policy -> Schedule: findOccupied(classroomId, slot)
Schedule --> Policy: 课表占用（或 DEGRADED）
Policy -> Repo: findActiveOverlaps(classroomId, slot)
Repo -> DB: 查询有效预约区间
DB --> Repo: 无重叠
Repo --> Policy: 无重叠
Policy --> Controller: ValidationResult(valid)

alt 校验不通过
  Controller --> UI: 422 RULE_VIOLATION\nfieldErrors + suggestedValues
  UI --> User: 展示原因与可替代时段
else 校验通过
  Controller -> Repo: saveNew(reservation, requestId, outboxEvents)
  Repo -> DB: BEGIN\nINSERT reservation\nINSERT notification_outbox\nCOMMIT
  alt 区间唯一约束冲突
    DB --> Repo: exclusion constraint violation
    Repo --> Controller: ReservationConflict
    Controller --> UI: 409 RESERVATION_CONFLICT
    UI --> User: “该时段刚被占用”
  else 保存成功
    DB --> Repo: reservation + version
    Repo --> Controller: saved
    alt 需审批类
      Controller -> Controller: status = PENDING_APPROVAL
    else 即时类
      Controller -> Controller: status = ACTIVE\n生成签到凭证
    end
    Note over Controller, Notify: 通知事件已随预约事务写入 Outbox
    Controller --> UI: 201 Created\n预约号、状态、version、签到时间窗
    UI --> User: 展示“等待审批”或“预约成功”
    Note over Notify, DB: 事务提交后由 Outbox 投递器\n异步推送用户 / 管理员；失败重试
  end
end
@enduml
